#: ../../reference_manual/seexpr.rst:366
msgid ""
"``cellnoise`` generates a field of constant colored cubes based on the "
"integer location. This is the same as the `PRMan cellnoise function <https://"
"renderman.pixar.com/resources/RenderMan_20/cellnoise.html>`_."
msgstr ""
"``cellnoise`` genererar ett fält av konstant färglagda kuber baserade på "
"heltalsplatsen. Det är samma sak som funktionen `PRMan cellnoise <https://"
"renderman.pixar.com/resources/RenderMan_20/cellnoise.html>`_."

#: ../../reference_manual/seexpr.rst:370
msgid "``ccellnoise`` outputs color cellnoise."
msgstr "``ccellnoise`` matar ut färgcellbrus."

#: ../../reference_manual/seexpr.rst:372
msgid ""
"float **fbm** ( vector v, int octaves=6, float lacunarity=2, float gain=0.5 )"
msgstr ""
"float **fbm** ( vector v, int octaves=6, float lacunarity=2, float gain=0.5 )"

#: ../../reference_manual/seexpr.rst:373
msgid ""
"color **cfbm** ( vector v, int octaves=6, float lacunarity=2, float "
"gain=0.5 )"
msgstr ""
"color **cfbm** ( vector v, int octaves=6, float lacunarity=2, float "
"gain=0.5 )"

#: ../../reference_manual/seexpr.rst:374
msgid ""
"vector **vfbm** ( vector v, int octaves=6, float lacunarity=2, float "
"gain=0.5 )"
msgstr ""
"vector **vfbm** ( vector v, int octaves=6, float lacunarity=2, float "
"gain=0.5 )"

#: ../../reference_manual/seexpr.rst:375
msgid ""
"float **fbm4** ( vector v, float time, int octaves=6, float lacunarity=2, "
"float gain=0.5 )"
msgstr ""
"float **fbm4** ( vector v, float time, int octaves=6, float lacunarity=2, "
"float gain=0.5 )"

#: ../../reference_manual/seexpr.rst:376
msgid ""
"color **cfbm4** ( vector v, float time, int octaves=6, float lacunarity=2, "
"float gain=0.5 )"
msgstr ""
"color **cfbm4** ( vector v, float time, int octaves=6, float lacunarity=2, "
"float gain=0.5 )"

#: ../../reference_manual/seexpr.rst:377
msgid ""
"vector **vfbm4** ( vector v, float time, int octaves=6, float lacunarity=2, "
"float gain=0.5 )"
msgstr ""
"vector **vfbm4** ( vector v, float time, int octaves=6, float lacunarity=2, "
"float gain=0.5 )"

#: ../../reference_manual/seexpr.rst:379
msgid ""
"``fbm`` (Fractal Brownian Motion) is a multi-frequency noise function. The "
"base frequency is the same as the ``noise`` function. The total number of "
"frequencies is controlled by ``octaves``. The ``lacunarity`` is the spacing "
"between the frequencies - a value of 2 means each octave is twice the "
"previous frequency. The ``gain`` controls how much each frequency is scaled "
"relative to the previous frequency."
msgstr ""
"``fbm`` (Fractal Brownian Motion) är en multifrekvensbrusfunktion. "
"Basfrekvensen är samma som för funktionen ``noise``. Det totala antalet "
"frekvenser styrs av ``octaves``. ``lacunarity`` är mellanrummet mellan "
"frekvenserna; värdet 2 betyder att varje oktav är dubbla den föregående "
"frekvens. ``gain`` styr hur mycket varje frekvens skalas relativt till "
"föregående frekvens."

#: ../../reference_manual/seexpr.rst:388
msgid "``cfbm`` and ``cfbm4`` outputs color noise."
msgstr "``cfbm`` och ``cfbm4`` matar ut färgbrus."

#: ../../reference_manual/seexpr.rst:390
msgid "``vfbm`` and ``vfbm4`` outputs vector noise."
msgstr "``vfbm`` och ``vfbm4`` matar ut vektorbrus."

#: ../../reference_manual/seexpr.rst:391
msgid "float **hash** ( float seed1, [float seed2, ...] )"
msgstr "float **hash** ( float seed1, [float seed2, ...] )"

#: ../../reference_manual/seexpr.rst:393
msgid ""
"Like ``rand``, but with no internal seeds. Any number of seeds may be given "
"and the result will be a random function based on all the seeds."
msgstr ""
"Som ``rand``, men utan några interna frön. Godtyckligt antal frön kan anges "
"och resultatet blir en slumpfunktion baserad på alla frön."

#: ../../reference_manual/seexpr.rst:396
msgid "float **noise** ( vector v )"
msgstr "float **noise** ( vector v )"

